Also, note that each test method should be annotated with:
`[Fact]` to compile as xUnit test.

Also note, for Pex to work, it requires the appropriate using statements. In this case, you would need to add `using Microsoft.Pex.Framework;` and `using Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting;`.

Remember to write your test cases as per your requirement and include proper annotations accordingly.

